{"name":"Bewitched","hex":"#6a393c","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bewitched","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Under a spell; subject to an act of witchcraft.","(Of a person) entranced, charmed, fascinated, as though subject to a magical influence."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of bewitch"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bewitched"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bewitched","blocks":[{"text":"Bewitched is an American fantasy sitcom television series that originally aired for eight seasons on ABC from September 17, 1964, to March 25, 1972. It is about a witch who marries an ordinary mortal man and vows to lead the life of a typical suburban housewife. The show was popular, finishing as the second-highest-rated show in America during its debut season, staying in the top 10 for its first three seasons, and ranking in 11th place for both seasons four and five. The show continues to be seen throughout the world in syndication and on recorded media."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/be/Bewitched_%28American_Broadcasting_Company_television_series_logo%29.svg/330px-Bewitched_%28American_Broadcasting_Company_television_series_logo%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bewitched","wikidata":"Q1044635"},{"title":"Bewitched (Laufey album)","blocks":[{"text":"Bewitched is the second studio album by Icelandic singer-songwriter Laufey, released on 8 September 2023 through AWAL. Described by Laufey as \"a love album, whether it be a love towards a friend or a lover or life\", Bewitched deals with a variety of romantic themes in its songs."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/06/Laufey_-_Bewitched.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bewitched_(Laufey_album)","wikidata":"Q122328530"}],"images"